<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Your site visit is confirmed</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f3f5f8;">
<div style="display:none; max-height:0; max-width:0; overflow:hidden; opacity:0; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; color:#f3f5f8; mso-hide:all;">Your site visit request has been approved.&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f3f5f8;">
<tr>
<td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px; max-width:100%; background-color:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e3e6ec; border-radius:10px;">
<tr>
<td style="background-color:#112149; padding:22px 32px; border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:3px; color:#ffffff;">JOHN KEELLS PROPERTIES</td>
<td align="right" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:1px; color:#e3c47a;">PARTNER PORTAL</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding:32px 32px 8px 32px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color:#1b1b1f;">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#e6f4ea" style="background-color:#e6f4ea; border-radius:20px; padding:6px 12px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1px; color:#1e6b34;">SITE VISIT CONFIRMED</td></tr></table>
<h1 style="margin:18px 0 14px 0; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:24px; line-height:30px; font-weight:bold; color:#112149;">Your site visit is confirmed</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:23px;">Dear {!Visit__c.OwnerFullName},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:23px;">John Keells Properties has approved your site visit request for <strong>[[Customer]]</strong>. The site visit is scheduled as shown below.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding:8px 32px 4px 32px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f3f8f9; border:1px solid #dfe9ec; border-radius:8px;">
<tr>
<td width="50%" valign="top" style="padding:16px 20px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
<div style="font-size:11px; letter-spacing:1px; color:#6b6b73;">CUSTOMER</div>
<div style="font-size:18px; line-height:26px; font-weight:bold; color:#112149; padding-top:4px; word-break:break-word; overflow-wrap:anywhere;">[[Customer]]</div>
</td>
<td width="50%" valign="top" style="padding:16px 20px; border-left:1px solid #dfe9ec; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
<div style="font-size:11px; letter-spacing:1px; color:#6b6b73;">PROJECT</div>
<div style="font-size:18px; line-height:26px; font-weight:bold; color:#112149; padding-top:4px; word-break:break-word; overflow-wrap:anywhere;">{!Visit__c.Project__c}</div>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="50%" valign="top" style="padding:16px 20px; border-top:1px solid #dfe9ec; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
<div style="font-size:11px; letter-spacing:1px; color:#6b6b73;">DATE</div>
<div style="font-size:18px; line-height:26px; font-weight:bold; color:#112149; padding-top:4px; word-break:break-word; overflow-wrap:anywhere;">[[Visit Date]]</div>
</td>
<td width="50%" valign="top" style="padding:16px 20px; border-top:1px solid #dfe9ec; border-left:1px solid #dfe9ec; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
<div style="font-size:11px; letter-spacing:1px; color:#6b6b73;">TIME</div>
<div style="font-size:18px; line-height:26px; font-weight:bold; color:#112149; padding-top:4px; word-break:break-word; overflow-wrap:anywhere;">[[Visit Time]]</div>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding:14px 32px 30px 32px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#fbf7ee; border-left:4px solid #775918;">
<tr>
<td style="padding:14px 18px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
<div style="font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1px; color:#775918;">AFTER THE VISIT</div>
<div style="font-size:14px; line-height:21px; color:#1b1b1f; padding-top:6px;">Once the date and time of the visit have passed, record the outcome on the Partner Portal: Leads → Edit → Visited, then choose this visit.</div>
<div style="font-size:14px; line-height:21px; color:#1b1b1f; padding-top:6px;">If the customer visited, click Update stage. The JKP CP team then takes the lead over.</div>
<div style="font-size:14px; line-height:21px; color:#1b1b1f; padding-top:6px;">If the customer did not come, click Customer did not visit. You can then request a new site visit.</div>
<div style="font-size:14px; line-height:21px; color:#1b1b1f; padding-top:6px;">To change the date or time, please contact the JKP CP team.</div>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding:20px 32px 24px 32px; border-top:1px solid #ebe9e9; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:20px; color:#6b6b73;">
Thanks,<br>
<strong style="color:#112149;">John Keells Properties</strong><br><br>
<span style="font-size:12px;">This is an automated message from the John Keells Properties Partner Portal.</span>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>